The four-axis verdict
Axis	Winner	Reason
Precision & recall (as specified)	A	The two named requirements are relational, not textual: workspace scope lives in tasks→projects→workspaces (a join Postgres already has) and priority mapping is a query-side CASE. In Option B both become denormalized index attributes — scope enforced by a second system that only knows the ACL copy you feed it, and a priority remapping becomes a full reindex of all tenants instead of a one-line change.
